+not allowed. A preflight `OPTIONS /api/totem/auth` from
+`http://localhost:8081` answers `204` with
+`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:8081`. The middleware is
+`App\Http\Middleware\TotemCors`; allowed origins get `GET, POST, OPTIONS` and
+`Authorization, Content-Type, Accept` request headers.
